I agree that they are in general too easy, though I did have one barbarian
come very close to death due to three cursed create monster scrolls read
by local monsters. 

My suggestion: remove the 14th level minimum requirement.  In 3.0j, the
player could descend to hell at any time he wished, all he needed was
a handy level teleport, etc. If the player decided to go for it very
early then that was his or her own problem.  Make it the same way for
quests, if you go for it too early, tough luck.

